Subject: [PATCH 1/2] engine: CGB/DMG hardware accuracy (IO readback gates,
 boot-ROM DIV)

Two emulated-hardware fixes needed so DMG-era cartridges behave per spec on
Game Boy Color hardware, carried over unchanged from v0.3 and v0.4.
